// Windows time zone equivalents for the IANA zone names used by the iPod city
// table, hand-mapped from the Windows time zone registry (CLDR windowsZones) and
// shared by src/tzinfo.cpp.  {iana_name, windows_id, fallback_offset_seconds}
//
// windows_id is "" when Windows has no matching zone; the offset is then used
// directly.  fallback_offset is the zone's current offset without DST and is
// used whenever the Windows lookup is unavailable, so it must stay exact for
// zones that never observe DST.
// This file is not generated from upstream; update it by hand when the city
// table (src/tzinfo_data.inc) gains a zone.

